  "verdict": "void",
  "section": "27",
  "quote": "shall specify the reason for entry, the day of entry and a time of entry between the hours of 8 a.m. and 8 p.m.",
  "reason": "Section 27 of the Residential Tenancies Act, 2006 restricts a landlord's entry on 24 hours' written notice to a specified time between 8 a.m. and 8 p.m. Because this clause attempts to allow entry between 7 a.m. and 10 p.m. and without specifying a time of entry, it is inconsistent with the Act and therefore void under section 4."
}

